    significant internationalization — winners from China (Tan Dun), India (A.R. Rahman), Iceland (Hildur Guðnadóttir), 
    and Italy (Nicola Piovani, Luis Bacalov, Ennio Morricone) reflect a globalized film music landscape.
  </p>
  <div class="insight">
